      	                   --------------------

  The last official release of the Lambda software was Release 4.0. This
  release was created to address deficiencies in the final 4.0 release.

  This release is EXPERIMENTAL. Bug reports may be made to the LispM list as
  described in the LambdaDelta README. Patches or updates will be released as
  they are available. No warranty is expressed or implied. 

  The kit consists of three tapes: An install tape, a system sources tape,
  and an options kit tape. The install tape can be installed as described
  in the LambdaDelta README. The system sources tape is meant to be restored
  using the Backup activity's Restore option. The options kit tape is meant
  to be restoring usng the Backup activity's Install Distribution option.

